================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY RUNTIME & MODEL ATTRIBUTION
================================================================================

This library uses the MediaPipe Tasks Vision WebAssembly runtime
(`@mediapipe/tasks-vision`) and loads pre-trained MediaPipe Pose Landmarker
(BlazePose GHUM 3D) model bundles (`pose_landmarker_lite.task`,
`pose_landmarker_full.task`, `pose_landmarker_heavy.task`) created by Google.

- Source: Google MediaPipe (https://github.com/google-ai-edge/mediapipe)
- Model Card: MediaPipe Pose Landmarker / BlazePose GHUM 3D
  (https://ai.google.dev/edge/mediapipe/solutions/vision/pose_landmarker)
- Copyright: Copyright 2020-2026 The MediaPipe Authors / Google LLC.
- License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)
